      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我明白你想说什么。\n挑战出道战不能算目标，\n所谓的目标应该是针对更远的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21d038700363b0cb74147c049171c47a22eea6969e788359d43169a9e38793b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
