      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，我只能将一切都赌在眼前的一战。\n这么一来，“现在”的我就能\n至少在这个世界留下一条确切的轨迹了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ebbf63233d506410ffbf4d8c0e384727f415b272a5f790761bd498b6cf929b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
